## show only, authored false
   a=null | boot a=true | A a=true | A
## show only, nothing authored
   a=null | boot a=true | A
## show only, authored true
   a=true a=null | boot a=true | A
## a false Condition, authored true
   a=true a=null | boot a=false | A a=false | A
## show and clear on one sink
   a=null | boot a=true | A a=false | B a=true | A a=false | B a=false | B a=true | A
## show and clear in one frame
   a=null | boot a=true a=false | AB a=true | A a=true a=false | AB
## show twice in one frame
   a=null | boot a=true a=true | AA
